spice
*SPICE Netlist
Vi 7 0 DC
I_Q 3 8 DC 1mA
C_C 7 3 C_C_value
R_i 3 2 R_i_value

* NMOS Transistor M_D
* Drain at 2, Gate at 3, Source connected to Ground at 5
M_D 2 3 5 5 NMOS_model

* PMOS Transistor M_L
* Drain at 2, Gate at 4, Source at 6
M_L 2 4 6 6 PMOS_model

Vplus 6 0 DC 3.3V
Vminus 8 0 DC -3.3V

* Output
Vo 2 0
